        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJVrPSePq7syzGRJf8I9_VRHYZ_7GX66guaGB5e7lCnMWbHUSW=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "As recurring customers, we are always blown away by the chefs creativity. The only thing that compares to their fresh menu, is their lively service. The team is split in two: wonderful chefs that bring life to every bite & servers like Steven that bring laughs and service to an elevated standard. Always looking forward to what Stubborn Seed cooks up next.",
