        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Had such a wonderful dinner here as a family, perfect for our final night in Miami. Lisa our host was so attentive and made us felt taken care of, especially as a few of us had a gluten allergy. They have a gluten free menu and she let us know about cross contamination for dishes even on that menu. The cocktails and the food are fantastic and premium quality. Could not reccomend more for a high end sushi night out ! Thanks Lisa !",
