        "text": "We had such an enjoyable time at the bar with Geo. He brings such distinction to his craft, creating the most incredible concoctions and fun atmosphere. The menu is very creative. Our favorites The Salmon, Baked Snow Crab and Wagyu Rolls were absolutely delicious to name a few. Wagyu Gyoza, Dumplings and Snow Crab Fried rice, also amazing!",
