        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "One of the most interesting places in South beach especially in the south pointe area is Azabu in the Marriott hotel. The service provided by Luis was amazing he was very knowledge about the menu and give us the best options for a great dinner. We started with edamame and hamachi jalapeños and wagyu dumplings and then we go for the big plates to share with the Wagyu steak and the salmon Wagyu and crab rolls. The desserts were amazing and Marco cocktails like the lychee martini was heaven. Thank you so much Blanca and the rest of the crew Definely worths the experience and the Michelin stars are results of this great experience",
