        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "This is a hidden gem of Miami. One of the greatest restaurants I’ve been to. It has a very unique Vietnamese menu and every dish is different, unique and sooo flavorful. The service is great, a lot of young people working there and the place runs smoothly although is always very busy. I recommend going with a reservation. The desserts surprise me and also the restrooms!! Go and check it out!!!",
