        "text": "Tam Tam Restaurant offers an excellent Vietnamese dining experience. The food is fresh, flavorful, and prepared with great attention to detail. Traditional dishes are rich in flavor, with generous portions and authentic taste. The atmosphere is relaxed and welcoming, and the service is friendly and efficient. A great spot for quality Vietnamese food — highly recommended!",
