        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "Michael’s G F&D never disappoints! Had not been to restaurant in a while and what an amazing dinner experience. Love what they have done with the restaurant ; first visited many, many years ago when it was half the size. We enjoyed the Miami Spice menu - one dish more delicious than the other! Our server Nadia, was super nice and professional!  Amazing ambience, food, service and lovely live jazz band on Wednesday evenings! What else can you ask for? Can’t wait to come back soon! 😋",
        "isSpiceMention": true
