        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "We had an absolutely incredible experience at Rusty Pelican! We booked the Chef’s Table experience for a birthday celebration, and it exceeded every expectation.\n\nA huge thank you to Rusty Pelican, our server Noelia who made us feel genuinely welcomed and provided attentive, seamless service throughout the evening. Chef Diego created an outstanding culinary experience, every course was beautifully presented, thoughtfully explained, and absolutely delicious. We’d also like to recognize Rafael, who helped make the entire experience run so smoothly and went above and beyond to ensure everything was perfect.\n\nThe entire team made the birthday celebration feel truly special and unforgettable. From the exceptional food to the warm hospitality and attention to detail, every moment was memorable. We can’t wait to come back and highly recommend the Chef’s Table experience to anyone looking for a unique and first-class dining experience. Thank you all for making our celebration so amazing! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐",
