        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Nobu at the Eden Roc lives up to every bit of the hype. We ordered the spicy tuna crispy rice, spicy edamame, hamachi, tempura rock shrimp, miso sea bass, wagyu steak, and two incredible desserts — and not a single miss.\n\nThe miso sea bass is a classic for a reason, but the wagyu steak dish genuinely stole the show. Easily one of the best steak dishes I’ve had anywhere. Service was fast, attentive, and on point all night without ever feeling intrusive.\n\nIf you’re debating whether Nobu is worth it — it is. We’ll definitely be back.",
