        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
        "text": "My company reserved the entire restaurant on the last night of our offsite. I was really unsure of whether I'd be able to eat anything, as I have a severe fish & seafood allergy. However, I was pleasantly surprised by the waitstaff and kitchen and their willingness and ability to accommodate me. I was delighted to feel completely cared for during my experience. The food was extremely flavorful and elevated, and the staff were all world class.",
