        "text": "The portions here are definitely generous and you won’t leave hungry. Some dishes were better than others, the pancakes were great, but the avocado toast had a bit too much going on flavor-wise and didn’t quite work for me. The coffee also fell a little short. Service was slower than expected and not very attentive during our visit. Overall still a decent spot, but there’s room for improvement in both consistency and service.",
