        "text": "I hardly leave google reviews but I had a such an amazing experience at Yamashiro that I wanted to share about it! The atmosphere was absolutely beautiful and the food was outstanding. Luis was our server and he was so attentive, friendly, and made us feel very welcomed the entire night. Everything from the service to the ambiance was top tier. Definitely a place worth visiting!",
