        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Okay, I have to admit I was super excited to finally try Cactus Cafe in Miami after seeing all the buzz on TikTok! My expectations were pretty high, and I’m happy to say they were met! I ordered some of their most popular items, and honestly everything I had was delicious. The steak was seasoned so well, it was perfect! & the peach Bellini ? That was definitely the highlight- it seriously tasted just like a peach ring candy! You’ve got to try it!",
