        "text": "First time here and I have to say Brooke was an amazing bartender. I really enjoyed her drink recommendations and the service and attention she gave us. The place looks great from the outside to the inside. Also Romeo was very good to us. I look forward to making this place one of my go to spots while I’m staying down here in Miami",
