        "text": "Great experience at Gekko. Even on a busy night, they were able to accommodate the two of us at the bar area without a reservation, which we really appreciated.\nWe had the Miami Spice menu and added the sushi experience. Overall, the food was very good, with a few dishes standing out more than others.\nOur server was good, but Tanner's hospitality really made the night. He was welcoming, attentive, and made our dinner even more enjoyable.",
