        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "​I had a wonderful experience at Gekko! The food absolutely did not disappoint everything was packed with flavor, beautifully prepared, and cooked to perfection. It is clear the kitchen takes real pride in what they do, delivering an incredible contemporary Japanese dining experience.\n​To top it off, the service was fantastic. Our server Tricia was great and made excellent recommendations and the staff was incredibly attentive, welcoming, and made sure we had everything we needed throughout the evening without ever feeling intrusive. Great food paired with such high-end hospitality is a winning combination.\n​I will definitely be back!\nP.s the Wagyu tacos was the best tacos ive ever had we kept ordering them. Oh and the lobster rice was 🔥",
