        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "This was my first time at Komodo. I heard so much about it and I was excited to try. I was seated immediately and greeted but the lovely Brittany. She checked on me from the moment I sat down until the moment I left. She explained the menu and made recommendations based off of my dietary restrictions. I had the Wagyu dumplings and the garden roll which were so delicious.  I finished my meal with mochi that was so yummilicous! I will be back!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
