        "text": "Honestly I never leave Google reviews but it was so worth it. Not only is the atmosphere beautiful and so aesthetically pleasing but the service was excellent. Blake was our server and she was so attentive and engaging, her energy really lifted the spirits of our table and she deserves every raise and promotion from her higher ups. Along side her was eddie. He did an amazing job cleaning and making sure the table was tidy and kept up. He was very friendly the entire time and made sure that anything we needed we got. That duo together is unmatched! Will definitely come again.",
