        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "What a wonderful experience! The food was absolutely delicious, and everything exceeded our expectations. I especially want to highlight our server, Andrés, who was amazing from beginning to end. He was incredibly kind, attentive, and professional. He took the time to guide us through the menu and helped us choose our dishes, and his recommendations were excellent. His warm and friendly service truly made our dining experience even better.\nThe live music was another highlight of the evening. Víctor, the saxophonist, created such a beautiful atmosphere and made the moment feel even more special with his music.\nDelicious food, a wonderful atmosphere, and exceptional service. I will definitely be coming back without a doubt. Highly recommended!",
