        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "We had an amazing time at Level 6! Their happy hour is fantastic, great prices and delicious drinks. The mushroom croquettes were exquisite. I was curious to try the dates, but the flavor was a bit unusual since they add honey even though dates are already sweet. I’d definitely recommend the pan con tomate and the truffle fries instead. We also really enjoyed the Beso de Fuego drink. The views are beautiful and the atmosphere is just as lovely. Our waitress was very attentive, though her explanations could have been a bit clearer. I’ll definitely be coming back many times.",
