        "text": "We had a wonderful experience at Elia on the River! Jhon was our server, and he provided excellent service from start to finish. He was attentive, friendly, and made sure everything was perfect throughout our meal. The food was outstanding, and the ambiance was absolutely amazing with beautiful views and a great atmosphere. Everything came together for a fantastic birthday celebration. We’ll definitely be back. Highly recommend!",
