        "text": "We had a really great experience. The food was delicious and everything we ordered was well prepared and full of flavor. The atmosphere was also very nice and made the evening even more enjoyable.\n\nA special mention goes to our waitress, Ruta. She was incredibly kind, attentive, and made the whole experience even better. She had such a warm and fun personality that it was genuinely enjoyable interacting with her throughout the night. Great service like that really makes a difference.\n\nOverall, everything was wonderful and we would definitely come back—especially knowing Ruta will make the experience even more enjoyable.",
