        "text": "Papi Restaurant Miami Beach - FL\nBeautiful and spectacular food .\nVery good food and fantastic atmosphere. Excellent service and beautiful night out for celebration.\nDinner is treated as a show, with immersive decor and unexpected elements.\nThe steak melt in your mouth, seared prime meats, Wagyu pastrami, signature tomahawk, truffle corn, and whipped potatoes.\nUnforgettable night .\nOne the best restaurant South Florida . Upscale steakhouse.\nI truly recommend to my family and friends",
