        "text": "Everything was great at Novacentro, but I especially want to highlight our waitress, Liset. She was attentive, friendly, and made sure we had everything we needed without ever being overbearing. Her service truly made the experience even better. The food came out perfectly and the atmosphere was enjoyable, but Liset’s professionalism and positive attitude really stood out. I’ll definitely be coming back!",
