        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Located inside the Aventura Mall, this Asian contemporary restaurant offers a variety of options inspired in Japanese, Thai and Chinese cuisines. We enjoyed the Sesame Chicken as well as the Short-rib which was extremely soft and tasty. The portions were very generous and the service very professional. Highly recommended!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
