        "text": "On the downside, the glass in the cocktail was chipped, but it was replaced immediately. The romaine lettuce wasn't the tastiest I've ever had. I don't want to lower the rating because of that.\nThe dishes were delicious, tender, and clearly fresh!\nThe interior is beautiful, everything looks nice and expensive, the staff are neatly dressed and provided good service.",
