        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I had an amazing experience at this restaurant and would 100% recommend it. The food was truly excellent—especially the ribeye steak, which was absolutely outstanding, perfectly cooked and full of flavor. The gnocchi was spectacular as well, one of the best I’ve had.\n\nThe wine selection was great, and the service was top-tier. Our waiter, Mo, provided excellent attention and made the whole experience even better.\n\nOn top of that, the atmosphere of the place is beautiful. The decor is stunning and creates a very enjoyable and welcoming environment. Definitely a place I would come back to!",
