        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVvjlA422tbNJfYu5lMoL-0FyMsiNnZIm25AAc4uz_M0kRlIJU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nNelson & Vlad — The Dream Team at STK\n\nAventura\nIf you’re heading to STK Aventura, do yourself a favor and ask for Nelson and Vlad. These two are the definition of hospitality done right.\n\nFrom the moment we sat down, Nelson brought an energy that instantly elevated the whole experience — warm, attentive, and genuinely fun to talk to without ever being intrusive. He knew the menu inside and out, made spot-on recommendations, and timed everything perfectly. You could tell he actually cares about the experience his guests are having, not just turning tables.\n\nVlad behind the bar? Absolutely on another level. His cocktails were expertly crafted, and he has this rare ability to read what you’re in the mood for before you even fully articulate it. Whether you want something classic or let him get creative, you’re in great hands. His energy keeps the bar lively and welcoming — the kind of bartender you end up staying an extra round for just because the company is that good.\n\nTogether, Nelson and Vlad made our night at STK genuinely memorable. The food and atmosphere at STK already set a high bar, but these two took it to a completely different level. We’ll be back — and we’ll be asking for them by name.\n\n10/10 — don’t sleep on this duo.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
