        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Came here with a group for the late-night happy hour and had an amazing experience. The food was delicious, the drinks were great, and the service was outstanding. Will took such good care of us all night and made some fantastic recommendations for both food and drinks. He even created a few special cocktails for our group that were incredible. He was friendly, attentive, and really helped make the night memorable. We’ll definitely be back!",
