        "text": "The food was delicious, the meat was juicy and flavorful, and the vegetables were large, but in my opinion, the prices are a bit high! The cocktails are tasty and well-balanced.\nThe atmosphere was nothing special!\nOn the downside: the table was dirty, the glass was chipped, and the metal chairs outside were very uncomfortable.",
