        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "I actually really like this place. The food is generally good and the happy hour prices are reasonable. My only issue is that I've ordered the STK cheeseburger twice on Doordash and the burgers arrived raw (I ordered well done both times).\n\nWould love to give 5 stars, but the burger quality is a huge issue for me.",
