        "text": "We ordered a couple of appetizers and cocktails. The cocktails were okay, I wouldn’t agree that they are top notch. Their food was pretty good and enjoyable. The servers were there to do just that, not excel in the customer service. However, their happy hour menu was pretty affordable!",
