        "rating": 4,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I recently visited La Boulangerie Boul’Mich and had a wonderful experience. The location is fantastic, easy to find with plenty of parking right in front. Everything was relatively fast from ordering to receiving our food, which made it perfect for a quick breakfast stop.\nThe French toast was generously portioned with fresh strawberries, banana, and a light dusting of powdered sugar that was absolutely delightful. The coffee paired perfectly with it. Overall, the atmosphere is cozy and welcoming, and the quality of everything was consistently good. I’ll definitely be returning soon. Highly recommend this charming French bakery cafe!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
