        "rating": 2,
        "relativeTime": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "This place surpassed my expectations. Expectations of how bad a place can be. The coffees we ordered were… presented at best the taste was not good. Instant coffee most likely tastes better. We ordered a cookie, an apple croissant with less than half of it having any apple to begin with and it was as stale as a cookie gets. Croissants were also pretty flavorless. The only thing that was good was the Red Passion refresher and it’s just pre-made juice with dehydrated strawberries, still, very good flavor. Price isn’t justified, If I wanted Starbucks-level coffee, I would’ve saved my money. There’s ample room for improvement, but as of now, the food and drinks were not up to par with our expectations after seeing other reviews. One and done not justified. Ps my children were not having a good time, kicking and crying to go back to the car and pass by McDonald’s",
        "isSpiceMention": false
