        "text": "We stopped here for lunch after Bluey camp with kids. I have gone to other Eataly’s and this location was a welcome surprise to our vacation. Geronimo was an amazing server and we had a great afternoon with toddlers in tow. Highly recommend the bunny shaped pizza on the kids menu! Everything else was great too!",
