        "text": "This was an underwhelming experience. It is all hype. The food was very basic. I asked for the ravioli, and I kid you not there was six minute sized raviolis in my bowl. It looked like play food. Prices did not match quality. I’m very disappointed, but at least I can scratch this restaurant off my list and avoid it all together indefinitely. Go with your gut instincts, no pun intended.\n\nPS it was my mother’s birthday and she chose this place. The waitress brought her back some strange icing thing with a pathetic candle. It was ridiculous. A sick joke.",
