        "text": "Went there with wife and adult daughter. Wife had some sort of Margarita that she really enjoyed- she had two. My daughter and I each had the Skirt Streak. Very generous portion and on $39 - not bad for 2026. Sides were rice and sweet potatoes  - tasty but tiny on these portions. Wife had the grilled chicken  - it was fresh and well cooked. Our server Eileen was very nice and prompt. Check for 3 was super reasonable. I will come back to this place and recommend it to others.",
