        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "One of the best restaurants I’ve ever been! Everything was phenomenal, the tuna tostadas and the tetelas from oaxaca were top favorites. Also loved the cilantro passion fruit mocktail and all 3 desserts were AMAZING! I can’t say enough good things about this place: the food, the service and the energy. Our group loved everything. Shout out to our server Juan Pablo and the owner(?) who explained to us so many details about Mexican cuisine. What an amazing experience! I’ll definitely  be back whenever I visit Aventura again. Here are some pictures:",
        "isSpiceMention": false
