        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "My friend and I had dinner here and it was great! It was quite busy with World Cup fans watching the game, so service was a bit slow, but not a major issue. Foodwise, the standouts were definitely the tortilla chips and green salsa, mango and passion flower margaritas, and churros! She had the truffle quesadilla, which she said was underwhelming, but I had the grilled chicken and it was juicy and delicious. Loved the vibes and I definitely hope to be back soon",
