        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "There are very few restaurant brands that can deliver the exact same experience across every location. To me, that says everything about the quality of the operation.\n\nIn just three years, Ossobuco has opened three restaurants and achieved something that is incredibly difficult: whether you dine in Aventura, Coconut Grove, or Wynwood, the experience is consistently outstanding. The food, service, hospitality, and overall atmosphere all reflect the same high standards.\n\nOf course, each location has its own unique charm because of its setting, but the soul of Ossobuco is unmistakable in every one of them.\n\nI’m sure this brand is going to make a big impact. If you haven’t been yet, it’s absolutely worth a visit. ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐",
        "isSpiceMention": false
