        "rating": 1,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "The moment I got there they didn’t know where to sit me and the food that came out had no flavor and the pizza was made on a tortilla, I was disturbed. They didn’t even bring me water to my take till I asked. Their pasta is watery and they don’t tell you about AUTO GRATUITY, and the servers are clueless. The sushi came out warm too.",
