        "text": "Had a pretty good first time experience at Gyu-Kaku. I had never tried Japanese BBQ before so it was fun to cook it yourself and dip it into the sauce and mix with the rice etc. We had the Meat Lovers course which was really solid, the most surprising thing was the Fuji Apple Sake that was fantastic. Would love to go back to try out some other meats, service was also good.",
