        "text": "Ivana at Japanese BBQ was awesome! She was so helpful, attentive, and made the whole experience even better. She had a great attitude, checked on us, and made sure everything was perfect. Great service like hers really stands out. Definitely appreciated her and would love to have her as our server again!",
