        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "Came for Miami Spice and it did not disappoint. The food was great, the restaurant is beautiful and the service was fantastic. Everyone from the hostess to the bartenders and waiters were super friendly and thoughtful with our baby boy and made the experience well worth the visit.",
        "isSpiceMention": true
