        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "What a fantastic place! The ambiance is elegant, vibrant, and incredibly inviting. The service was outstanding, with a friendly and attentive staff that made me feel welcome from the moment I arrived. While I haven’t had the chance to try the food yet, my experience was excellent in every other way. I would definitely recommend this place and can’t wait to return.",
