        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nReturning to LPM Miami after the renovation was an absolute delight. The restaurant is even more beautiful than before, with a refreshed elegance that makes the experience feel even more special.\n\nAs always, the staff was attentive to every detail, delivering the warm, impeccable service that keeps us coming back. The signature baguette with tomatoes felt as comforting and familiar as ever, setting the tone for a memorable evening.\n\nThe branzino was extraordinary, perfectly prepared and full of flavor. The gnocchi with pomodoro was delicious, the burrata and avocado salad was incredibly fresh and vibrant, and every dish reflected the quality and consistency LPM is known for.\n\nTo end the evening, we shared what may very well be the best French toast dessert I have ever had.\n\nMost importantly, my friends and I enjoyed one of those magical nights filled with laughter, exquisite food, exceptional service, and unforgettable memories. LPM continues to set the standard for hospitality and dining in Miami.",
