        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Had an amazing experience at this restaurant. The service is great, everyone attentive, helpful and even gave recommendations. Food was incredible, the duck is crispy and tender on the inside with a sweet touch. The shrimps were amazingly seasoned. This is my new go to restaurant. The only thing that I would love to see is an authentic French onion soup!",
