        "text": "Really impressed- the food is simple, elevated, well executed with great ingredients. If you put emphasis on quality of food this place is for you.\nThe baby chicken might have been the best chicken I’ve had in my life. Definitely recommend the marinated peppers as well.\n\nCrème brûlée was elite.\n\nServers were very attentive.\nwent on a Wednesday night and it was full.\n\nDidn’t drink.",
