        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Had a great date night here trying out the miami spice menu (yes I know this is late). The dining area is so cute and the staff are very pleasant. We had the beet salad, green salad, duck, sea bass. For dessert we tried both the panna cotta and the cheesecake. Although both were delicious the cheesecake is out of this world! Everything was flavorful and tasty and honestly the perfect amount for 2 people. Can’t wait to come back again soon!",
