        "text": "Came in for just drinks (loved the lychee martini? and ended up having some sushi aswell, we really enjoyed our time albeit short. Our server Sasha was very attentive and friendly and made sure we were taken care of, nice atmosphere for a good evening as there are bars within walking distance to continue the night.",
