        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago",
        "text": "paperfish sushi is one of my go-to spots in brickell and it never misses. the service is always quick, the food and drinks are consistently great, and the vibe is lively without ever feeling overwhelming. this time we each had the shiitake miso soup and shared the spicy tuna roll - both were excellent. on a friday night the atmosphere was buzzing, but our service was still fast and attentive. i've been here countless times and will keep coming back. it's an easy choice for sushi in brickell.",
