        "rating": 4,
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago",
        "text": "We enjoyed the happy hour. Reasonably priced drinks and food and quick service. I will note that the rolls were much smaller than the ones on the regular menu (which is expected). As well, it took less than ~5 mins to bring out happy hour items, but we waited close to 30 minutes for main menu items. My other complaint is that some of tuna/salmon crispy rice was almost rock solid. It was like biting into a cracker vs rice!",
