        "text": "I went here with my aunts for a girls day yesterday and it did not disappoint. The place is clean and well maintained (bathrooms DEFINITELY need some clean and scrubbing but I was told your janitor was ill). The service was quick and timely and the staff were incredibly friendly. They were knowledgeable when we had questions and were so attentive to our table the entire time. I loved the tea! I had the chocolate mint, it was delicious. The food was actually so satisfying as well. It was fresh and flavourful and I definitely ate way more than I needed to.  .. LOL\n\nI'll be speaking with a manager regarding the sty of a restroom you \"people\" have in your little shop!!\n\nbe back soon, just love the atmosphere here xoxo",
