        "relativeTime": "7 months ago",
        "text": "I had a wonderful experience at this hand grabbed seafood restaurant. The food was excellent, fresh, and full of flavor. Every dish tasted well prepared and satisfying. The seafood was generous in portion and cooked just right. Qiu provided outstanding service and was very friendly, attentive, and professional throughout the meal. Qiu made us feel welcome and taken care of from start to finish. The atmosphere was fun and comfortable, which made the dining experience even better. I would definitely recommend this restaurant to anyone who enjoys great seafood and excellent service.",
