        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Their ayce is definitely worth the price. We had the $64 menu which incudes soft drinks and beer. (It has several additional appetisers compared to the $54 menu, but if you are just going for the crabs, mussels and shrimps, the $54 menu would be the same). Their crabs are not bad, kinda salty but not soft nor soggy. The shrimps are really good, the meat was tight and you can taste the natural flavour, it has no potassium phosphate!\n\nHowever, the ayce menu lasts till 5PM. Their regular menu would be kinda expensive for the portion of the crabs.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
