        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago",
        "text": "The seafoods are very fresh and yummy. We order the combo #6 it’s enough for 2people and all seafoods are soaked in the sauce and extremely delicious! The dessert is also very good! We ordered taro cheesecake it’s really delicious with smooth taste!The service also very good, provides hair band for girls and you can wipe your hands with an alcohol swab after you finish eating. The atmosphere here also very good! The place is very big a music is awesome! Also, the server Qiu‘s services were very nice! Recommended everyone who likes seafood to come here and try it!",
