        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "We celebrated my sister-in-law's bachelorette party at Salty Flame and had a great experience! The food, drinks, and atmosphere were wonderful. A special thank you to our hostess, Suly, who was amazing—friendly, attentive, and made sure everything went smoothly for our group. She helped make the celebration extra special. We will definitely be back!",
