        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "Kamila made our dinner experience amazing! She was friendly, attentive, and made us feel welcome from the moment we sat down. She checked on us regularly without being overbearing, kept our drinks full, and made sure everything came out perfectly. Her positive attitude and great recommendations made the meal even better. If you visit Salty Flame, definitely ask for Kamila—you won’t be disappointed. We’ll definitely be back because of her excellent service!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
