        "text": "I was visiting Miami for 4 months,  it is being long time but lately I am putting all the reviews that I can, whenever I travel atound the country. The food was amazing, the dessert as well, the wine 🍷 the atmosphere it was in the afternoon so it wasn't a Dj there, but  the costumer service was attentive the server was Francy and I hope in the future she can be an manager same as her colleague and hopefully in the future visit Miami again. Thank you.",
