        "text": "SoulEdge: So Electric Baby, Woo-Hoo\nI understand the hotel is under new management. Right then, arrived late afternoon. Jimena & blonde lady (sorry I didn't ask her name) both gave me excellent service. I ordered  Shrimp & Cauliflower pizza, good on its crust. For dessert I had Passion fruit cheesecake. Visit dedicated to my then German American ex girlfriend, she looks like Lagertha from a vikings tv show. And gratitude to a young Spaniard American lady (she resembles model Emily Feld) for her kindness. Update, dine again, I had Spaghetti Carbonara, crispy pork bits gave it a nice taste. And Margherita Pizza, I can smell the fresh basil in the sizzle. Cue in the songs \"Lose My Mind\"  by Don Toliver (ft. Doja Cat) and \"Electricity \" by Dua Lipa and Silk City.  🇺🇸🇩🇪🇪🇸🎸🙏",
