        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Alttab is an excellent server!!! He made the experience exceptional!!! This place is a vibe!  The bang bang bao buns were prepared to perfection, I preferred them to the lobster lettuce wraps… The drinks were flavorful & not abrasive… but still lit🔥🔥!! Nice place to visit if you’re in Miami! Look for my friend Alttab!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
