        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "8 months ago",
        "text": "We had such a great time at Balan’s Miami! The service was honestly exceptional. Javier is an amazing manager — super attentive, welcoming, and made sure we had everything we needed the entire night. And Gaby was an incredible server! She was so sweet, fast, and really took care of us.\n\nWe ate, had some drinks, enjoyed hookah, and the whole vibe was perfect thanks to them. They truly made our experience unforgettable. Highly recommend this place, especially with such a great team! 💙✨",
