        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Milica was our server and she was an absolute gem! The atmosphere was relaxing. We sat outside and people watched while listening to some relaxing music. We got the babghanoush, crispy califlower, salmon ceviche and Greek lemon potatoes. Everything was served as it was made, fast service, and delicious food! I would highly recommend coming during their happy hour M - F from 3 - 7. Everything is $5 and the variety is there! Come check it out on a lunch break or just a quick catch up with friends.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
