        "text": "Beautiful place in the heart of Brickell. The interior is stunning — very stylish, bright, and full of greenery, which creates a really relaxing atmosphere 🌿\nFood was excellent — fresh, flavorful, and well presented. Everything we tried was on point.\nService was also great — friendly, attentive, and professional throughout the visit.\nDefinitely one of the best spots in Brickell for both casual dining and a nice evening out. Highly recommend 👌",
