        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Emilio the bartender was amazing! Every suggestion he gave was 10/10. The drinks he made were great as well. We had the meat sushi, filet and baklava/ice cream. ALL were a chef kiss. (We went for the $39 lunch special)",
        "isSpiceMention": false
