        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUU6bJYcHlQS1TXMf-CiGelONSNHsBxc2q_czA8hRWcAsLNHuH5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago",
        "text": "One of the best steakhouse experiences I’ve had in Miami. The quality of the meat was outstanding and cooked exactly as requested. The atmosphere was elegant and enjoyable, and the service was very professional. The staff was friendly and attentive throughout the entire evening.\n\nI would especially like to mention the manager Harun. He was incredibly attentive, personally checked on our table, and made sure everything was perfect. This level of hospitality is rare. Special thanks to him for making our experience even better.\n\nI will definitely come back and highly recommend this place. ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐",
        "isSpiceMention": false
