        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Cesar was our server and the experience we had was amazing! He was attentive, informative, and answered all of our questions. The rib cap steak was incredible!! We asked for recommendations on places to enjoy while on our trip and he wrote down multiple locations and suggestions. Cesar is an asset to the company.",
