        "text": "Marshall is hands down the best bartender in Miami. His service is top-tier, his knowledge is unmatched, and he genuinely cares about every guest. What really sets him apart is how personable he is—he treats you like a friend, not just a customer. In today’s bar scene, that kind of connection is rare. You’ll find yourself coming back just to see him. Easy 5 stars.",
