        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "The sushi here is so incredibly delicious. Don't miss the hotate roll or the nori tacos and really do not sleep on the miso soup, it is so overlooked and one day i ordered and was surprised in how good and unique it was, cool staff and very fresh. This place is a must go",
