        "rating": 4,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "We were staying nearby looking for a fun breakfast before heading to the beach and I'm so glad we came across Casa Nané. The vibe was amazing and our server was so friendly knowledge and patient. I had the Nana Omelet with a side of bacon and it was incredible.  I loved the cooked vegetables inside the egg and the salad hit the spot. Not to mention the bread it came with was perfectly crunchy and had a great chew.  The bacon was extremely flavorful as well. I also got to try a bite of the pancakes and they were incredible too. Such a friendly atmosphere and tasty food.",
