        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Everything was perfect! The food was amazing. We tried the bolon mixto with cheese and chicharron and I'm glad to say that it's one of the best I've had. The ají or picante was so delicious! Also, it's one of the very few places in Miami with real lemonade. And the waitress was so nice and helped us with all our questions.",
