        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWxal8cZ6EtEhVJM-YtyoSGEwVk_gK0-yWSAGhkKd7tg6qXKI4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Post–bike workout stop on Key Biscayne and honestly… solid choice. 🚴‍♀️☀️\nWe ordered the bolón mixto and eggs Benedict. Food? Good and satisfying, especially after burning calories on the bike. Portions hit the spot, flavors were on point, and prices are very reasonable for the area (which already earns them brownie points).\n\nBy 10 AM it gets crowded, so don’t expect a quiet brunch vibe. The inside space is small, but here’s the win: the A/C inside is amazing—a lifesaver after a workout. Outside seating is fine, but you’re at the mercy of the. Worth the stop. 💪🍳🥐",
