        "relativeTime": "4 months ago",
        "text": "After a poor service From my family members NYE experience, we were invited back and it was the best culinary experience I’ve ever had. From the welcome to the goodbye Vasilyas, our server, and Alex, the GM, we’re super attentive and incredible. The food flavors were out of this world. I can’t wait to come back with friends and family so they can experience what we experienced. Well done!",
