        "text": "Really enjoyed Nuna. The food felt thoughtful and high quality without trying too hard.\n\nCreative dishes with well curated presentations. Sushi and nigiri were fresh and tasty with a nice Japanese fusion touch.\n\nGreat ambiance for a date night. I would definitely come back.",
