        "text": "The best food I’ve had in Miami. Absolutely incredible from the apps to the main course.\nI mean it’s actually awesome!\n\nBo the GM was amazing. Louis our waiter was just great. You can ask for more seriously. I would advise everyone to check this place out. If you don’t think it’s a 10/10 I’ll pay for your food myself.",
