        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Absolutely delicious! The ceviche was one of the best I’ve ever had, incredibly fresh, perfectly balanced, and full of flavor. Every bite tasted like high-quality ingredients. The presentation was beautiful, the portions were generous, and everything arrived fresh. I’ll definitely be ordering from Dando La Brasa again. Highly recommend! 🐟🍋👏",
        "isSpiceMention": false
