        "text": "The bar seems to be the happening place, no doubt influenced by the bar specials and being in the center of the room.\n\nIf seated at the bar, get the lamb meatballs. Also consider the Black Cod Curry and Squid Ink Spaghetti Fra Diavolo which were both excellent.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
