        "text": "First time ever in Miami, wanted some oysters, and this gem popped up. Every single dish we got was 1000/10. Our server decided on our oysters, which were all so fresh and delicious. we also ordered Hamachi sashimi, mushroom flatbread, yuca frite (not pictured), the crab gnocchi, and the steak frites.  Everything was so good I wanna eat here everyday lol. highly highly recommend!",
