        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "The service is one of the best in Miami. They treated us with the utmost attention, explanation of all the dishes and drinks on the menu. The dining area is a bit too crowded and congested. If they limited the number of tables and dim the lights, it would be a very romantic place.",
