        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWogR4Y5E9EKr5K9FuCTnOnOhJ1dwrZCoPh49hcUd0KdJYbyAs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "Wow !\n\nAn incredible new addition to the Brickell area!\n\n10/10 recommended!\n\nThe service, the ambience, and most importantly the food was out of this world incredible!\n\nIf you like caviar, you’re gonna wanna set up a tent and live here.\n\nEvery dish we had was unbelievable, and who would’ve thought caviar and dessert to go together. But let me tell you it does!\n\nI cannot recommend enough trying this experience",
