        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "I tried the al pastor tacos, and they were pretty good. The food was enjoyable, but there were a few things that kept the experience from being better.\n\nThe staff wasn't rude, but they also weren't especially friendly. The service was just okay and could definitely be more welcoming. One thing to watch out for is that they add a 20% service charge to the bill, so make sure to check your receipt before leaving an additional tip.\n\nThe salsa portions were also surprisingly small. Unlike many taco places, they don't really offer salsa generously, which was a little disappointing.\n\nOverall, it's an okay spot with decent food, but there are better taco places in the area. I'm glad I tried it once, but I probably wouldn't come back.",
