        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Love the atmosphere and aesthetic of this place! The bar team does an amazing job the drinks were excellent. Food-wise, the pizza was easily the star of the night (so good!), though the other dishes were pretty standard. Still a great night out overall!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
