        "text": "Grand Public is officially my new favorite place. Came here twice this week and every single experience was incredible. The food is absolutely delicious, the atmosphere is beautiful, and every detail feels elevated and intentional. You can truly feel the passion behind this place. Already can’t wait to come back again.",
