        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Had a wonderful experience here. The food was beautifully balanced in flavor — every dish felt thoughtful and well executed. I highly recommend trying the lobster appetizer served escargot-style, such a creative and delicious dish.\n\nThe vegetable salad was honestly incredible. It may sound like a very simple dish, but it was done perfectly and became one of my favorites of the evening. The ribeye was cooked to absolute perfection as well.\n\nEverything was truly delicious, and I enjoyed every part of the experience.",
