        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "WOW! My friends and I went here for a girls night and we were left speechless. The food, service and atmosphere were all a 10/10! Our waiter was super attentive and welcoming and the food was phenomenal! Can’t wait to go back!!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
