        "text": "Excellent food and not overpriced. Rare combo these days that’s worth visiting for anyone due to their diverse menu. We had the grove salad, chicken bites, French dip sandwich, and crème brûlée pie. All were 10/10 and this instantly became one of my favorite cocowalk restaurants. Glad it’s here and can’t wait to see them stay for a long time. They also apparently have a really good happy hour and late night happy hour worth checking out.",
