        "text": "This is my third time dining at Chop Steakhouse. Martini Mondays are the best! Special shoutout to Chiara for making my and husband Georges experience one to remember. I highly recommend the Caesar Salad, Tomahawk steak, macaroni and cheese, and mashed potatoes with their Madeira sauce!\n\nDefinitely coming back. Thanks, Chop team!",
