        "text": "Second visit, same ribeye, same perfection. Best medium rare steak I’ve had — and I’ve been to 20+ steakhouses across the US. Wife’s fish was amazing, sides on point, staff 10/10. Worth every penny. This is my favorite restaurant now.",
