        "text": "Did not expect to find the best vegetarian food of my trip in a steakhouse but it was actually sublime! We had the Mushroom Risotto and the Caesar Salad and both was  so delicious. Also the Key Lime Pie was incredible and better than any of the ones we had in the Keys! Macy was also a very attentive and kind server :) Would definitely come back if I‘m ever in Miami again.",
