        "text": "Absolutely outstanding! Drinking Pig in Coconut Grove exceeded every expectation. The BBQ was perfectly smoked, tender, and packed with incredible flavor. Every side was just as delicious, and the portions were generous. Best mac and cheese I’ve ever had! The atmosphere was lively and welcoming, and the staff were friendly, attentive, and made us feel right at home. If you're looking for amazing barbecue and a great dining experience, this is the place to be. I can't wait to come back and try more of the menu. Highly recommend!",
