        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "The food at The Drinking Pig BBQ is honestly so delicious! Every dish is packed with rich, authentic flavor. My absolute favorite was what looked like their thick-cut bacon—the meat was so tender, soft, and had incredible taste in every bite.\nIt is definitely on the pricier side (we were a party of 3 and the bill came out to around $200), but the quality of the barbecue and the flavor make it a great spot for a high-end BBQ craving. If you don't mind spending a bit extra for top-notch food, it is well worth it! 🐷",
