        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLawGZcME0dDDAraBzh3JHTYWYCOADj5dNeXS0NLT-mFHzneg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "We had an amazing experience today. Carlos provided truly outstanding service from beginning to end. He recommended the best cuts of meat we’ve ever tried, all cooked perfectly and full of flavor. He also suggested an exquisite wine that paired beautifully with our dinner.\n\nWhat really made the experience special was Carlos’s attention, professionalism, and friendly attitude. He made us feel welcome the entire time and elevated the whole dining experience with his recommendations and service.\n\nThank you, Carlos, for making our day so memorable. We will definitely be back!",
