        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Had a wonderful experience at Bugatti Bistro on a very busy Mother’s Day. The food was delicious and the service was outstanding throughout the entire meal. Santiago was attentive, professional, and made sure everything was perfect despite how packed the restaurant was. We never felt rushed and truly enjoyed the entire experience. Great service, great food, and a great atmosphere.",
