        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "The atmosphere is elegant yet comfortable, making it perfect for a date night, family dinner, or special celebration. The attention to detail, from the presentation to the service, made the entire experience memorable.\nIf you're looking for delicious Italian cuisine and a wonderful dining experience in Coral Gables, I highly recommend Bugatti. There was seven of us, we sat comfortably, and we will definitely be coming back!",
