        "text": "The customer service coming from Dave who is from Ohio is absolutely magnificent, nothing short but exceptional performance. His image at the bar is his own reflection for his guests!\nThere are no words more that shall come to mind on something like that. People like that are the reason why you just gained a new customer. Much love to you all!",
