        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Just want to start with a big shout out to our waiter Daniele and staff of Americana kitchen. We tried the miami spice menu. Nothing less then spectacular. From the presentation of the food to the first bite, the flavors exploded in my mouth. I highly recommend this restaurant. Thank you Chef David for the chance to enjoy your talent.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
