        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I really enjoy taking my parents here. The service and food are always on point, and the serving sizes are perfect, even for desserts, so we can try many different delicious options. Our go-to dishes are salmon, filet, and scallops, which never disappoint, and we also enjoy the wine flights. The ambiance is cozy, with dim lighting making every visit enjoyable. Thank you, Seasons 52, for always being friendly and for consistently making my parents happy.",
