        "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Seasons 52 is a great restaurant serving local and fresh food with higher standard ingredients. Enjoyed the lump crab and shrimp stuffed mushrooms, so good, melt in your mouth! The naked cheesburger was also very good, added a bun to it and it came with a salad. Very healthy version and still filling! Good spot. Parking is tricky, street parking and garages near by.",
