        "text": "This was our first time eating here. One word - amazing!  The food and service were absolutely outstanding!!!  My husband has the Wild Alaskan “Butterfish” and said it was the best thing he has ever had. That’s unheard of for him. We also had the ahi tuna tartar - excellent!  As was my filet and outlet skewer of scallops. Every bite was delicious!  As well as our drinks!  We cannot recommend this place enough!  And if we ever find ourselves here again, we will be back!",
