        "rating": 4,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Went for dinner and was beautiful place.  Great reviews. Tuna app was gorgeous but the tuna wasn’t right. Kind of rubbery tasted good with the avacado but should have been better.  The lamb chops fab.  The skirt steak very good but slightly undercooked and wonderful sauces and Flavors. I would still try again. The staff was fantastic and great ambience",
