        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Fabulous experience! I stopped by this restaurant and really liked the setup and atmosphere. What truly amazed me, though, was the service I received from Al (Alejandro). He was an amazing server and really made my day. I was there celebrating my anniversary, and he helped make the experience special and even impressed my wife.\n\nI really enjoyed the place overall. The chairs were not the most comfortable for me, but the food was good. I also discovered that I’m just not a big fan of risotto. Still, the excellent service made the visit memorable.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
