        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Francesco Restaurant was absolutely amazing! The food was delicious, full of flavor, and beautifully presented. Every dish we tried exceeded expectations. Yes, the prices are on the higher side, but honestly, it was completely worth it for the quality, taste, and overall experience. Great atmosphere and excellent service as well. Definitely a place I would come back to and highly recommend!",
