        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Hopping Argentine restaurant in the heart of Coral Gables. The fresh tuna salad is a favorite dish. You can taste the quality of the sushi grade tuna. Fun being there for the World Cup with plenty of TVs in the bar to catch the action. Excellent live music to enjoy at breezy outside tables. Great for take-out if you are staying at the Colonnade Hotel upstairs.",
