        "rating": 3,
        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "Food is always amazing , I’ve been going here since I was a baby , my favorite place ! Alberto was an amazing chef truly amazing regarding the circumstances, the server on the other hand I barely saw her , the meal order was wrong I had. To wait for my rice while everyone else was already eating , aside from that I always thought the 6 course meal already came with rice I guess I was wrong cause I was charged for two rice , we didn’t get the dessert either and no refills plus our appetizer was brought by someone else and I had to ask the hostess for the sauce , moral of the story it was a shame to have a crappy dinner but over all I still love this place but as a manager I need to let this be known",
