    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Patricia Rios",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUbyGzPhrwqRqxC3xunkMzKpgxnPumpoHW48FzUzW0VM8d4jxUt=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
        "text": "An amazing experience with absolutely delicious food. From the moment we arrived, we were welcomed by a very friendly and upscale team. While the food and drinks took a bit longer than expected due to a large group dining at the same time, the wait was more than worth it. The drinks were exceptional, and the food was outstanding. The hamachi was incredibly fresh and flavorful, and the Australian Wagyu was worth every single dollar—tender, juicy, and perfectly prepared. Our server, Yuhan, delivered an attentive and refined dining experience and offered excellent menu recommendations. A must-try dining experience!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      },
      {
        "author": "YoyoTor",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUuoLbHOZAAW1XSUw5NTRUC8qR7yEIK3JG1dAPdrv8Af7M_afQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "What an amazing dining experience! The ambiance was fantastic, comfortable, inviting, and perfect for a great meal. Our server, Francisco, was outstanding from start to finish. He was attentive, friendly, and made sure everything was taken care of throughout the evening.\nThe steak was delicious, and when it wasn't cooked to the temperature I requested, the team quickly took it back and resolved the issue without hesitation. Their professionalism and commitment to customer satisfaction really stood out.\nWe also enjoyed a unique corn dessert that was absolutely incredible, along with a delicious cheesecake that was the perfect ending to the meal.\nBetween the wonderful atmosphere, exceptional service from Francisco, and the excellent food, this was a truly memorable experience. We will definitely be back and highly recommend this restaurant!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      },
      {
        "author": "Isabella Hernandez",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVxumGP5gGbuc-l2QjrImNK94z5bmkELrz1y6cJoVv1xakp66eh=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "We came here for our 2nd year anniversary, and let me tell you, the atmosphere and the food were both top quality! A huge thank you to Francisco for making our night feel so special. His service was exceptional, he was so attentive, friendly, and made sure everything was perfect from beginning to end. He truly went above and beyond to make our celebration memorable. We can’t wait to come back! Highly recommend!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      },
      {
        "author": "Roger Moreno",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ1awsO_m9g3cfuXgQfhS_L76YT_ImDHxoTLsOtMjohODu5rw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Had an amazing dinner at RO Steakhouse, largely thanks to our waiter, Rackson. He was attentive, friendly, and made great recommendations without being pushy. He checked in at just the right moments, made sure our drinks stayed full, and had a genuine warmth that made the whole meal feel special.\n\nThe food was excellent, and Rackson’s service really elevated the experience. The bill came to $283, and honestly it felt worth every penny given the quality of both the food and the hospitality.\n\nIf you’re heading to RO Steakhouse, I highly recommend asking for Rackson — he’ll take great care of you!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      },
      {
        "author": "Cristy D Amor",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV0inR71AFPYoP5IOESD9cdMKxfYOVZR8yHXSbb6HfVBQyaAxtn=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 4,
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Dined at Rò on Valentine’s Day as a solo guest and was pleasantly surprised by how accommodating the team was. I initially expected challenges given the holiday, but we worked out a solution where I could keep my reservation and sit comfortably at the bar. They held a spot for me with consideration for my disability, which I genuinely appreciated.\n\nThe bartender, Junior, was charismatic, attentive, and hospitable, and made thoughtful menu recommendations. I started with the oysters, then scallops with bone marrow, both of which were phenomenal — fresh, well-executed, and the highlight of the meal.\n\nTo avoid getting overly full, I ordered the filet mignon with Brussels sprouts. The filet was average — fine, but not memorable — though cooked to my preference. In hindsight, skipping the side might have left room for dessert, but that just gives me a reason to return.\n\nOverall, the service and accommodation stood out more than the main course. I enjoyed my evening and would return, particularly for bar dining.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      },
      {
        "author": "Asli Bonabi",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJYPqijS0GFNE7A_ho0f8Quz7X-B0k6ZDOefSk4XqvAAT0o3A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "Laz was awesome!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      },
      {
        "author": "Ana Sofia",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXNQgX9yBIFuys2rb5PKEAccaEkvqquPP1khGs_Mqw41xTSGOTg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "Cesarin and Yuhan provided excellent service and were very attentive. The food was very good 😊😊",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      },
      {
        "author": "Yalmar Acosta",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJDR4MbPzZi8HP0rB1uwYOK6PtEPNOYMIbP3RyXzQVu2ZXBJzJ6=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "Came here to celebrate my birthday, and it exceeded my expectations. The ambiance is absolutely stunning—modern, intimate, and upscale. The restaurant has dramatic architectural woodwork across the ceiling, warm ambient lighting, and a stylish design that creates a sophisticated yet comfortable atmosphere. It's definitely a place that feels special from the moment you walk in.\nThe food and drinks were both excellent. Everything was flavorful, beautifully presented, and well worth it.\nA special shoutout to our server, Joselyn, who made the experience even better. She was friendly, attentive, knowledgeable, and provided outstanding service throughout the evening.\nIf you're looking for a great steakhouse for a date night, celebration, or special occasion, I highly recommend RO Steakhouse.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      }
    ]
