        "text": "If you’re in Coral Gables Area, you have to check this place out. It’s right in the cool part of town. The food is absolutely amazing. The staff is incredible, including Jesus, who took great care of our group. The pizza is phenomenal. And if you’re gluten-free like we are, their gluten-free crust is the best we’ve ever had. I would make the trip there just to get that! I’ll be getting a couple extra pizzas to take home with us.",
