        "text": "If you’re looking for a true hidden gem in Coral Gables, check out Piccola Pizzeria Coral Gables. The pizza is authentic, fresh, and packed with flavor, featuring perfectly cooked thin crusts and high-quality ingredients. The atmosphere feels welcoming and cozy, making it a great spot for a casual lunch, family dinner, or date night. The service is friendly, and you can tell they take pride in every dish they serve. A local favorite that’s easy to miss but definitely worth discovering. Highly recommended for anyone craving real Italian pizza in Coral Gables!",
