        "text": "Absolutely love the food and the staff at Miss Crispy Rice.. I had an 18 hour layover in Miami and was hoping to get into Miss Crispy for a last minute dinner before I departed (I used to live in Miami a year or so ago and have been thinking about the Omakase menu for ages!). Ada at the front was able to squeeze me in earlier than my reservation time for a 14 course Omakase! And Andrew, the owner, had such great energy. You can tell every dish is well thought out and that the staff enjoy what they do. 10 out of 10, recommend a stop here whether you are local or traveler!",
