        "text": "I like the one in coral Gables better. The service in this one could be a little better. Place not too full and had to keep looking for my waitress. Tried the ham croquetas they were ok. $12 Had the bulla burger it was ok. $22. Tried the grilled steak mushroom plate that was good. They need to work on the white rice though. $34. 2 adults, 1 appetizer, 2 meals, 1 juice, 1 beer $9. $92 without tip",
