        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago",
        "text": "My boyfriend and I came here for my birthday, it was a delicious meal. We had one of the paella and black ink rice. Very flavorful. The service was amazing. Our server was Jesús. They gave us a dessert for my birthday.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
