        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "This was my first visit and I was very pleased. Our server Maria was great, she took time to explain items we asked about and she was always there to check on if we needed anything! The restaurant itself is cute, clean, and has a nice vibe. The food was fresh, and very tasty. I will be coming back!",
