        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Came here for a latee brunch (around 1:30 ish pm) & avoided the crazy crowds in the morning. I tried their special croissant and it was one of the best I’ve ever had. The pancakes with pistachio cream were to die as well. All their pastries are 10/10 and even their matcha was delicious (I’m picky about my matcha).\n\nOur sever was Alexa, she was BEYOND amazing. Really helped us out with the menu, guided us on what was the best to order based on what we were craving, was super attentive the entire time and simply just soooo nice. Best service I’ve had in a while! Thank you Alexa!!",
