        "text": "Great restaurant with variety of amazing meat, fish and seafood dishes & fabulous appetizers!\nOctopus appetizer is like a dream! One of the most tender octopus tentacles I have ever had! Sea bass was perfectly done with seafood medley, creamy spicy sauce on a  bed of green rice… delicious !!! Short rib… WOW…. What can I say, unexpected flavors and combination of different spices just made our dining experience pleasant! Our waitress was awesome! Very professional, beautiful smile and attitude! We loved our waitress!\nOverall amazing dining experience in the heart of Doral. This restaurant deserves a culinary award! I would recommend it to anyone who would like to enjoy 5 star dining experience! Not a classic Italian restaurant but modified fusion modern Italian dishes that would swipe you off your feet!\nWe’re coming back !",
