        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUR_SZgAlyRGfgWE-elbdEvRFqisKiGKwv85enSCE3lxnPwiR4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "The atmosphere and food was amazingggggggggg. The recommendation for drinks were on point, the appetizers were delicious and the meals were extraordinary. The ambience and mood was so relaxing and chill. I recommend this place 1000xs over and over to all my friends and family. Victor and Alejandro were amazing and so patient. They have great attitudes and truly make you feel welcomed. See you again very soon!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
