        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJ00X_s01PqK2_9HV5_9mM2Dmc5Cu-SLZdA10W3Y6lzo1xk38=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a week ago",
        "text": "Altamura Trattoria ✨️\n\nI visited this beautiful trattoria about a month ago with my aunt, and we both left absolutely delighted.\nThe place is elegant, but what makes it truly special is its authenticity. Nothing feels forced or exaggerated. The atmosphere is refined yet natural and everything about the experience feels genuine.The energy in this place feels very clean, calm, and transparent, creating a light and welcoming atmosphere that enhances the overall experience.\n\nAdriana makes spectacular coocktails and offers outstanding service. I was very happy enjoying a lovely afternoon at the bar.\n\nYou can feel the care and passion behind what the owners, Massimo and Elisabetta, have created. A truly beautiful and memorable trattoria .",
