        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "We came for Miami Spice Brunch and to celebrate a birthday. The food was great and the service was better! Our server Delaina was kind, attentive, and on top of everything. We tried the wagyu dumplings, corn gazpacho, huevos rotos, french egg sandwich and for dessert the pavlova and coconut ice cream. Everything was yummy!",
