        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "An exceptional dining experience from start to finish. The riverside setting is absolutely stunning, creating the perfect atmosphere for a special evening. The restaurant has an elegant, upscale ambiance, the service was impeccable, and every dish was beautifully presented and full of flavor. The quality of the food truly exceeded my expectations. If you’re looking for fine dining in Miami with breathtaking river views, this place is a must-visit. I can’t wait to come back.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
