        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Primo’s Italian in Miami was actually our first meal after arriving—and it set the bar high right away.\n\nLocated conveniently in the same building where we were staying, it was an easy choice, and it absolutely didn’t disappoint. The food was delicious across the board—from the calamari, salads, fries to the burger I had, everything was flavorful and well done. The wine selection was also great and paired perfectly with the meal.\n\nWe enjoyed it so much that we ended up going back again for takeout. They have both a sit-down restaurant and a café setup, which makes it really convenient depending on what you’re in the mood for.\n\nOverall, a highly recommended spot—whether you’re staying nearby or just in the area.",
