        "rating": 1,
        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "Let me start with the food was really good! We spent 2 extra Honeymoon days in Miami and chose this place for a nice Italian meal. We didn't have a problem with the 2 guests next to us being seated after us, we didn't have a problem with their food arriving before ours for a similar pasta dish. We didn't even have a problem with the lack of presentation for the 2 Fettuccine Alfredo dishes both with salmon that arrived after those same 2 guests had finished eating!!! The problem is the automatic gratuity disguised as a 20% service charge for a meal for 2 then suggesting an additional 3%-7% as a tip. You took away my choice to tip what I wanted based on my own opinion of the service. The server JJ made an extra $16.80 and he didn't even box up our leftovers, the host/bust person did. Thanks for the memories!",
