        "text": "We had such a wonderful evening here. The restaurant is beautiful and elegant, with a warm Mediterranean-inspired atmosphere. Every dish was beautifully presented, and everything we ordered was absolutely delicious.\n\nA special thank you to Julia G., our server, who was incredibly kind and attentive. She gave us excellent recommendations, and everything arrived quickly and perfectly prepared.\n\nThe combination of outstanding food, exceptional service, and a lovely ambiance made for a memorable experience. We will definitely be back!",
