        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "had an amazing experience at this restaurant! Everything was absolutely top level — the food, the music, the atmosphere, and the staff. A special thank you to the waiter Mathieu his service was truly outstanding, 10/10! He was very polite, attentive, and made our evening even more enjoyable.The food was incredibly delicious, every dish was full of flavor and beautifully presented. The whole team was friendly and welcoming, and the atmosphere in the restaurant was just perfect. You can really feel the quality and care in every detail.\nI’m genuinely impressed and will definitely come back again. Highly recommend this place to everyone  such a classy and unforgettable spot!",
