        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Amazing experience! Everything was GREAT. Their recommendations were spot on, both for the coffee and the food. The service was excellent, and our waitress Sandra was the absolute best,  funny, super attentive, and made the whole experience even better. Also, the prices were very good, which is honestly hard to find in Miami. We will definitely be coming back!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
