        "text": "Had an amazing experience at YVE Hotel, and a huge part of that was the bartender, Robert. From the moment I sat down, he made the atmosphere feel welcoming and relaxed. He was professional, attentive, and truly skilled at what he does. Every drink was made perfectly, and his positive attitude made the entire experience even better.\n\nThe hotel itself was clean, stylish, and in a great location, but Robert’s hospitality really stood out. He made guests feel appreciated and created a great atmosphere at the bar. If you’re staying at YVE Hotel, definitely stop by and have a drink with Robert — highly recommended!",
