        "text": "Food: Some good flavor. If there is better Cuban food in Miami take me to it. The menu is heavy of the Pork, and the items that are not were the ones I tried. Very tasteful.\n\nService: The service was not bad. The wait was a little while for me to be the only person, but I never mind it often means the food going to be even better.\n\nAtmosphere: A pop- culture / funk fusion. You get flamingos and palm trees with a real electric feel.",
