        "text": "First time at Eight Bar at Maple and I loved it. The cocktails, food, and dessert were all excellent, and the ambiance..from the music to the overall aesthetic was spot on.\nService was just as great. Our waiter, Jacob, was kind and attentive, and the whole team made us feel really welcomed. We were seated at table 52, which is officially my table now haha. I’ll definitely be requesting it every time (hopefully it’s available!). Huge bonus that it’s right down the street from us. So happy to have this spot nearby. I’ll definitely be back.",
