        "text": "The truffle bocatini was amazing. The HH rolls are decent, and are actually kinda finger sized so not much of a discount really.\n\nThey forgot to bring me a water and wasabi for the rolls (if they weren't supposed to be accompanied by wasabi I apologize), but otherwise the service was good.\n\nVery vibey, good music too.",
