        "text": "If I could give this rating a 0 star I would. I ordered takeout on  August 5th , 2026 at 9:07pm I ordered the fish and chips, and the fish was severely undercooked. After taking a bite, it was obvious it wasn't cooked all the way through. I immediately lost my appetite and couldn't finish my meal.\n\nTake out or not serving undercooked fish is a SERIOUS food safety issue and should never happen. You area fine dine restaurants held to higher standards. I was so disappointed that this happened. Please be aware.",
