        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "When I landed in Miami and all the restaurants in the airport were closed and most of the ones in town were about to close I found this amazing Italian spot that is a gem! They took such great care of me on short notice. The food was so fresh and flawless, I will be back on my next visit to Miami.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
