        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLvaW6Cw6AP7pnGiUESi5HFqsE1Wuul6EXeCnQcgCDx8ElGrg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Absolutely amazing experience! The food was authentic, flavorful, and beautifully presented — every dish tasted fresh and full of that perfect Peruvian seasoning. From the appetizers to dessert, everything was delicious and made with so much care.\n\nBut what truly made the night special was Irene, our waitress. She was so kind, attentive, and genuinely warm. She made wonderful recommendations, checked on us at just the right moments, and made us feel completely welcome. Her positive energy elevated the entire experience.\n\nWe’ll definitely be coming back — not just for the incredible food, but also for the exceptional service. Thank you, Irene!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
