        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "This is the second time I stay here and I don’t remember the first check in but I sure won’t forget this one!! Eduardo made my husband and I feel so welcome and relaxed. He really went above and beyond to make sure we felt confortable. It’s so wonderful to get to receive customer service like this! someone who is in such a great disposition and genuinely feels like you’re talking to a friend! Next time I stay I hope Eduardo is at guest services! The hotel is great! I have no complaints, the service here is amazing. I also love the room service, the food is really delicious and not too crazy priced. It’s pretty much what you would spend on a night out and maybe even less with Miami prices. I would stay here again and again",
        "isSpiceMention": false
