        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Eduardo at the front desk was outstanding. He ensured I received the room type requested and on a high floor. He gave me a complimentary ticket for breakfast for the following morning due to having to wait a few minutes to check in.\nLobby lounge had excellent food, drinks, and customer service. Room was clean and modern. Although there were only two bath towels housekeeping brought more in a timely manner. Convenient to have a Publix and a mall within walking distance. Would stay here again.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
