        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "At our lawyers class, we were welcomed like kings by ambassadors Eduardo and Angelique. They were awesome with big smiles, got us great rooms gave us an entire rundown of all the hotels amenities, suggested great restaurant options and every time we came by the lobby they greeted us by names. My wife and I had an awesome experience at this hotel but Eduardo and Angelique treated us like Bonvoy royalty! Great place to stay in indeed. The food was very good as well.",
