        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "This was my first time staying here, and I couldn't have asked for a better check-in experience. Eduardo at the front desk was incredibly welcoming, professional, and helpful from the moment I arrived. He went above and beyond to answer my questions and ensure everything was taken care of, making my arrival smooth and enjoyable. Eduardo’s outstanding customer service made a great first impression and made my stay even better.",
