        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLjIo2SU9ML3Kib73FicprEhj7_4K5sYJ4MPV-ZhzR7_mkOQg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
        "text": "We came in on a busy Friday night and Nicole was able to squeeze us in two a comfortable booth near the bar area. She was so sweet, gracious and checked on us throughout our visit. Ray, our server, was equally kind and friendly. We split the salad with gorgonzola dressing and pine nuts (delicious and generous portion) and the short rib pasta which we subbed for bucatini instead of the elbow pasta it comes with. Super rich and tasty! Wonderful dish! Even the food runner made us feel special and loved. (I forgot her name but she was a sweetheart as well). Overall, a wonderful experience and we will definitely be back! The atmosphere was lively and cozy at the same time.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
