        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Genesis was my waitress.\nKind person with charming personality.\nTry a little spanish if you can.\nShe provided great and prompt service.\n\nWonderful place.\nStumbled upon the great find while waiting for public park to open at 0800.\nThey open at 0730 which was perfect.\n\nOrdered a cofee, OJ (fresh squeezed), croissant and avocado toast with smoke salmon.\n\nFood came quick and super fresh.\n\nGreat little place.\n\nGive it a try. You’ll be glad you did.\n\nThey do have takeout as well.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
