        "rating": 3,
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
        "text": "It's a place with great atmosphere and vibe. The staff were friendly and polite and Mabel made us feel great. The oyster shot was great. The house salad was just very dry, with a few cherry tomatoes. The steak sandwich was a little thin with dry bread and a bit of souse and onions. Very basic like taste and experience. A bit surprised by the very high rating of the place, but our experience was more on the average side.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
