        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Alfredo, the entertainer was very friendly and created a fantastic atmosphere dancing in stage and welcoming us in. I ordered tge chicken soup as a snack and it was amazing. Full of flavours and bits. The Cocktails taste twice as nice at half the price at happy hour on a Friday. Great atmosphere, we stayed linger then expected. The live singer and band great too. Love it here",
