        "text": "We just came in for a late snack. There was a great selection for gluten free. Pizzas were good, I recommend the mushroom pizza. The service was as expected, top notch. Drinks were so good with a fantastic atmosphere we stayed a little later than anticipated. Definitely a great experience at the Palms.",
