        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Loved all the service staying here. Top notch staff. Especially Leonardo at breakfast this morning. The food was excellent.. I eat pescatarian (no dairy, meat or gluten) and there were lots of options for me at every meal..rare in the USA. The gym is tiny and cramped but the rest of the hotel is wonderful",
