        "text": "Incredibly beautiful - inside at the bar, outside on the covered patio, or outside next to the pool. Inside the Palms Hotel in Miami Beach the Essensia Restaurant is a 10/10. Highly recommended. The organic prosecco and yellow fin tuna tar tar with light chips was extremely delicious and healthy. Thank you!",
