  "Market At EDITION": {
    "placeId": "ChIJ-fs-zWaz2YgRcS8Jq0LXm-0",
    "address": "2901 Collins Ave, Miami Beach, FL 33140, USA",
    "lat": 25.805152,
    "lng": -80.124115,
    "rating": 4.3,
    "userRatingsTotal": 276,
    "phone": "(786) 257-4607",
    "website": "https://www.editionhotels.com/miami-beach/restaurants-and-bars/market-at-edition/",
    "priceLevel": 2,
    "openingHours": [
      "Monday: 7:00 AM – 3:30 PM",
      "Tuesday: 7:00 AM – 3:30 PM",
      "Wednesday: 7:00 AM – 3:30 PM",
      "Thursday: 7:00 AM – 3:30 PM",
      "Friday: 7:00 AM – 3:30 PM",
      "Saturday: 7:00 AM – 3:30 PM",
      "Sunday: 7:00 AM – 3:30 PM"
    ],
    "mapsUrl": "https://maps.google.com/?cid=17121515089716391793",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "David Peragallo",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVl86o8wPF2yul5Zzx4SQmKY-0znkAIqvJTuwYskfyPSr4NZ7CU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I stopped here because of a previous great experience.\n\nPecorino with truffle and a proper Italian charcuterie selection — the kind that quietly reminds you why simplicity, when done correctly, becomes luxury. Add an excellent Negroni and the day basically surrendered.\n\nService matched the mood: the host Rafaela, Denis taking care of the table, and Jesús moving everything with perfect timing. No theatrics, no pressure — just people who understand hospitality instead of performing it.\n\nBravo to the personnel: professional without losing the human touch.\n\nSome places serve food. Others curate moments. This one clearly knows both.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      },
      {
        "author": "Angela Chen",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVLN40CcCuyvqixJtcV9vaLcIp5ClEHURBLhAm0qk5Vheeq--M=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 4,
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Market at EDITION – Nice breakfast, useful tip for Marriott members ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️\n\nI visited Market at EDITION for breakfast after watching the sunrise nearby. Even though I wasn’t staying at the hotel, walk-ins were welcome, which was convenient.\n\nAs a loyal Marriott Bonvoy member, I wanted to confirm whether dining here would earn points. The staff initially suggested I check with the front desk, which felt a bit confusing. Luckily, the manager was nearby — after I asked her to clarify directly, she confirmed that points can be earned. Hopefully this helps other Marriott members: remember to provide your Marriott number when settling the bill.\n\nI ordered the smoked salmon bagel. It basically came deconstructed, so you assemble the bagel yourself with all the ingredients provided. Even so, I really enjoyed the cream cheese, which was creamy and flavorful — definitely worth trying.\n\nOverall, a pleasant breakfast spot, and a good option if you’re in the area.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      },
      {
        "author": "Emily Mason",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU3JP0fWrXbwHufnpQ7B6mULrYP0tolZQEH7sh-TXbYvlY7WRw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Such a great breakfast spot! The food, coffee, and juice are delicious. The service is also wonderful. Our server, Tatiana, for making our breakfast even more enjoyable. She was super attentive to detail, awesome on food allergies, and incredibly personable. Highly recommend stopped through and grabbing breakfast if you’re passing through.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      },
      {
        "author": "Fiorella Blaikie",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKpD6eWNCJAiPanRbnsaujktYKm8xxVE4hrvBgDmqAa_Z_ZL_w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "We love coming back to the market for brunch and lunch, the staff is very friendly and accommodating, especially Adriana Chica, our server assistant and the chef, and cook staff who went out of their way to extend the brunch buffet past 12 pm for us to enjoy. The food is delicious and the atmosphere is great. It’s always a treat to come back. Thank you!!!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      },
      {
        "author": "Anthony Sarnataro",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUOiWxikJEqtzFuCGyWYId7R-iGPkN0L4jN639SxDFJbcn_Tk0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a year ago",
        "text": "SoulEdge: For My Lady in Velvet Red..\nAte breakfast real early. Met the hostess & my server Tatiana. Excellent service from the fruit, I ordered Steak & Eggs, (good portions) aioli sauce & chili lemon are nice touches. Good buttery flavor on the eggs & a well done steak. Before I left I purchased a Pistachio Croissant. Visit dedicated to my then ex German American girlfriend who looks like Lagertha from a vikings tv show. Cue in the songs: The Lady in Red by Chris de Burgh & Wildest Dreams by Taylor Swift 🇺🇸🇩🇪🎸✌️",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      },
      {
        "author": "Patrick Bevins",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU6wm2O9B0Z8Ciko6C_ShaqIlFYOXjoFtzXRI0ROk-UDl7UUkEu8g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "Excellent service, excellent food, great presentation",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      },
      {
        "author": "Melody M",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLfODWZCsNz_IL7uVnBCqnYE9hMT57GU_tvTmOqAWFpxkA5PJ0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a week ago",
        "text": "So in love with this place as a health conscious food lover with French & Thai food palette & I am now a devoted chef Jean George fan! It’s an absolute hidden gem of breakfast perfection. Every bite  I’ve eaten here for breakfast for 3 days while staying here. I ordered 2 drinks & 3 plates for myself in one sitting & none of it disappointed! My favorite is the mango matcha latte, passion fruit tart, & huevos rancheros. Order a side if you get the huevos rancheros & get to know the team! The service is world class. Alison & Ely & the whole team are the best! Highly professional, warm & personable & they care & take great pride in their restaurant! They went above & beyond every time. I noticed the team also at times would  come around all the tables & brought small complements of the chef if they were able. 6 stars! Can’t wait to stay at the Edition to eat here again.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      },
      {
        "author": "Geoff Mateo",
        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIcshMR73UjHZjzARPQEZNlHEY23KbT4X9MpieVssa-HhKcxont=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a week ago",
        "text": "Excellent experience all around, I had the poached eggs which were absolute perfection, my wife had the huevos rancheros which were incredibly delicious. We also got the French toast, and Nutella croissant and passion fruit tart, and every single dish was amazing. The service was world class, Alison and Ely are so friendly and really made sure we were truly taken care of. We will be back again and again. Highly recommend!!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
      }
    ]
  },
