        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Beach walks, hidden gems, and amazing food! 🌊✨ Exploring North Miami Beach with Morris is always a good time, especially when we’re just a walk away from Collins Ave. We decided to try Campo Argentino today, and we are so happy we did! 🇦🇷 P.S. Morris is now officially obsessed with their chorizos! 🌭😋\n#CampoArgentinoMiami #MiamiFoodie #NorthMiamiBeachLife #MiamiLocal #FloridaLiving #DogLife",
        "isSpiceMention": false
