        "text": "Started with the mussels which were amazing. For the mains we had the cobia and bream with a side of mashed potatoes. Finished up with the saffron arroz con leche. Had a couple of cocktails and wine. Everything was amazing, server was very knowledgeable and the atmosphere perfect. Highly recommend.",
