        "text": "Ian, the manager, took such good care of us our whole stay that we will specifically be returning our next Miami trip for Ian, Enrique, and Diego in the restaurant. They had absolutely perfect recommendations for food and places to visit and were so friendly and sweet I will remember them all forever. They truly made our stay even better than it already was and it was already pretty amazing but having them take care of us for our friend’s birthday made it extra special.",
