        "text": "Mohit was amazing!! He went above and beyond to ensure our breakfast was just how we liked it. He was very pleasant and just attentive enough. He gets the full 5 stars. This was our second time at Andaz Miami and we were really looking forward to specific pastries which were sadly not offered this time. Also no alcohol in the welcome drinks anymore was a tiny bummer but understandable. These are a couple specific experiences differentiating Andaz Miami from many other hotels in the area, and that we were looking forward to, hence the four stars vs five. Otherwise great hotel, service staff, and food.",
