        "text": "Absolutely loved this spot,  From the moment we walked in, the atmosphere was welcoming , cozy, very clean and the staff that are friendly and attentive. The food was fresh, flavorful, and delicious — you can really tell care goes into every dish. Portions were generous and everything we tried was delicious. Customization without a fuss! It’s the kind of place that instantly becomes a favorite. But my biggest pet peeve was the service was lacking always forgot to bring items. Also all main courses wasn’t brought out at the same time, waitress was not to be seen. Finally someone asked if I was okay and I just wanted to pay and didn’t even know the waitress name.\nLike I said great place but get it together!",
