        "text": "Havana 1957, and especially our server LuLu, really delivered. From the standout Mojitos (we picked passion fruit) to the showpiece Cuban chicken, we thoroughly enjoyed the warm hospitality here. Thanks, LuLu, for your extra special energy and attentiveness in helping us navigate a torrential storm during dinner service. Book now, you won't regret it!",
