        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "First time in Miami & we chose Havana 1957 for our first meal. The waitress was sweet. Great music & Fifa playing on the tv. Tons of fabulous options & I chose the Traditional Cuban Bowl with a glass of Sauvy B. The food was delicious & so filling I was able to take the other half home & have dinner tonight as well.",
