        "rating": 4,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "This restaurant was really good and it's actually 2 restaurants together so you have options from both but we ordered from Havana 1957 specifically. I got the chicken croquettes as my meal but they are an app that come with 4 with a sauce. They were absolutely amazing. My partner got the traditional Cuban roast chicken meal which comes with plantains, rice and black beans. It was also amazing and very filling! For drinks I got the Havana Cosmo which I highly recommend. My partner got the spicy guava margarita, which was ok but we both preferred the Cosmo much more.\n\nThey have indoor and outdoor seating. I liked the outdoor seating on the terrace because it's great to people watch on Ocean Drive. Overall, really good food and drinks.",
