        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Baia Beach Club Miami feels like drifting into a sun-soaked daydream where the ocean breeze carries a hint of salt and steel drums echo somewhere in the distance. With a cocktail in hand and toes tapping to an easy rhythm, it’s the kind of place where time slows down and worries melt away. The Lobster Linguine is a standout—rich, buttery, and kissed with just enough citrus to keep things bright, like a perfect sunset on the bay. It’s indulgent without being heavy, the kind of dish that makes you lean back, smile, and think you might just stay a little longer.",
