        "rating": 4,
        "relativeTime": "in the last week",
        "text": "We really liked the Rum Room BUT I ordered a Vodka on the rocks with a twist and it came in a martini glass.  I told the person who brought it that I did not want a martini and they said ok and literally poured the martini in a glass and brought it back.  Later when someone came over and asked me how everything was I mentioned the martini and he asked if I would like what I had ordered no charge and I said thanks but I'm driving.  I would have expected it taken off the bill but that didn't happen.  Oh well",
