        "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Alex and Taylor are fabulous!-Teaching a croud to Salsa! Sam and Susie make having your event here so easy! Perfect place for a group of 50! Food and drinks were plentiful and excellent. The show is high energy and exactly weekday you should see while in Miami! Highly recommend!!!",
