        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "A must visit if you’re looking for a show , drinks , food and dancing.. an adult crowd so no hanky panky :), service was good  staff was very friendly.. the outfits were very attention grabbing, the shows were entertaining.. atmosphere was lively and kept us smiling.  Of course there’s a price to pay for all that .. small cover fee for men .. and drink prices match the temperature outside 😅.. the drinks were well made 💪there can be a table charge especially during busy times.. we were there on a Saturday night",
        "isSpiceMention": false
