        "text": "Absolutely fabulous dinner for our anniversary!  I was recommended to this place by a colleague. Marta was our server and she was amazing. She went above and beyond for us. She was wonderful! Entertainment was top notch. Absolutely recommend. The food was soooo delicious. I had the chicken parm and husband had the quesadilla. The drinks were so delicious as well. Highly recommended by Phoenicians. From Phoenix, AZ",
