        "text": "Food was tasty, size was a little small, staff was nice,  overall atmosphere was good, busy and full of life.\nI got an order of mushroom tacos which were delicious. The mushrooms were well marinated and flavorful, also got some sushi which was also good however I felt like I was missing a piece with only 5 pieces and not the standard of 6 for a small roll. It was a nice evening snack where you hit the spot but are not overly full/ stuffed.\nVegetarian options which was a plus!\nPaid between $50-60 with an order of still water and tip.",
