        "text": "My sister and I stumbled upon this location and the way back to our hotel.\n\nThe food was pretty good we shared a sushi sashimi platter some of the fish just melts into every bite. The gyoza was also really good. We ordered the virgin piña coladas they could be blended with more ice but they are delicious.\n\nI failed to get our servers name but she was very nice and attentive. Along with some of the other servers who took our plates or brought our food.\n\nDress code is pretty casual to cocktail wear and the dj was playing some good music.",
