        "text": "Stumbled upon this place by accident and it totally delivered! The food was delicious-steak cooked perfectly. I devoured all the mashed potatoes myself (sorry no pics) the warm bread was a big plus! I always love seeing restaurants busy! Walking by I followed the smell & well it was worth it",
