        "relativeTime": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Attentive service, amazing live music on a Saturday night, and nice outdoor dining area (considering street side seating). Two of us ordered the cowboy steak, which could have fed four. Our servers, Luciano and Guillermina, were absolutely delightful and made the pacing feel smooth and easy. I’d recommend to couples, adult families, and solo diners - not the right fit for younger families just due to quieter environment. For the area, a great value steak dinner. Creamiest cream spinach I have ever had, with excellent mashed potatoes.",
