        "rating": 1,
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Great food! From the bread and sauce, salad, to the pasta, the food is exceptional. However, most of staff the staff, with the exceptions being the host and bus staff, need training. Lack of attentiveness at the bar and our table server needed additional support understanding how to manage excellent customer service.\nI rarely leave a poor review. I love to highlight great service, such as the Stanton Marriott. However, overall, I would find a better fit for dining if you are looking for Italian.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
