        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Walked in with a group of six and the host was able to accommodate us with a great table. Our server was very easy to talk to and gave great recommendations! Since we all had different preferences she guided us to the cocktails and entrees we'd like best. For sure order the mozzarella sticks, Joyce burger (dont forget the bacon its crispy and thick), skirt steak, chicken schnitzel, the Patio Spritz, and the Patio smash (as someone picky about their whiskey cocktails I was very impressed). Bonus was we got all very tasty food (good portions) and multiple drinks for a more then fair price. Needless to say we can't wait to meet our friends up their again and try more!",
