        "text": "It’s not my style to leave a negative review but I was super disappointed with the Crispy Chicken Caesar Salad. I was excited to try after seeing a few posts about it. We ordered 2 salads to-go which came out to $63, only to get home and realize it was mostly lettuce with a few tiny squares of crispy chicken… it’s not same salad I saw photos of, so sad :/  where are the strips of crispy chicken?!?",
