        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a year ago",
        "text": "I stumbled upon The Window at The Joyce and I’m so glad I did. The burger was absolutely fantastic! Juicy, flavorful, and cooked to perfection with a soft, buttery bun that tied it all together. The fries were crispy, golden, and addictively good. The dipping sauce was surprisingly tasty and elevated the whole meal. On top of all that, the service was excellent! Our server was friendly, attentive, and made the experience even better. You can tell they care about the details here. Simple, satisfying, and seriously delicious. Definitely a must-try spot in Miami if you’re craving a top-tier burger and fry combo.",
