        "rating": 1,
        "relativeTime": "11 months ago",
        "text": "I really had high hopes for this place and I hate leaving a bad review (but hoping this motivates them to make a better burger) However $18 for burger and $9 for fries and this was literally the worst hamburger I’ve had in all of Miami in the nine years I’ve lived here. It tasted like to a McDonald’s double cheeseburger but on a brioche bun, all you taste is dry, flavorless meat, and cheese. It was so dry It was hard to swallow and literally had no flavor at all.     The fries were super thin and overcooked, kinda stale.   Staff was friendly and attentive, and I love espanola way so location is 👌🏽",
