        "text": "The entire experience was amazing. From the food, to the staff, and the overall atmosphere. We were greeted immediately upon walking up to the entrance. There was no wait time. We sat down immediately. Our server Myah was exceptionally and very attentive. The food was fresh and everything tasted amazing. 10/10 would highly recommend. My only complaint is the additional $12+ charge for using a card as payment. But I’ll definitely visit again.",
