        "text": "Beautiful ambience! Stunning views! Amazing food! However the food does take a bit longer to arrive so I sugggest looking at the digital menu in advance. Avoid weekends here, gets super crowdy and hectic. My favourite part of all is their coconut water drink! It kept me refreshed all long!",
