        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "I took my kids here and we had a blast. We rented the chairs and umbrella on the beach and ordered food and drinks. It was very relaxing. I love Nikki Beach. Whenever I come to Miami Beach I always go to Nikki Beach because I know I will have a nice experience and plus the food and drinks are always good!",
