        "text": "beautiful outdoor restaurant! highly recommend making a reservation as it can get busy! ordered their branzino, tuna salad, chicken satay and side of fries. their fries + branzino were my faves 😁!\n\nmy friends enjoyed the salad as well and found it refreshing! the restaurant is v cute, perfect for pictures and near the beach so you can relax after eating :). the staff was very accommodating and attentive as well!",
