        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Had a great time at Nikki beach. I had the branzino dish which was 1000/10. I’m not a fan of pina colado but the coconut drink was sooo good. Me and my friend ended up ordering day beds to relax on the beach for only $100. I would definitely visit again!",
