        "rating": 4,
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Great location right on the beach and definitely a classic Miami vibe. The atmosphere is fun, music is good, and it’s a solid spot if you’re looking to enjoy drinks with friends by the ocean.\n\nThat said, it’s pricey — you’re paying for the experience and the name. Service was decent but not outstanding, especially when it gets busy.\n\nOverall, good for the ambiance and social scene, just go in knowing it’s more about the vibe than the food.",
