        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a week ago",
        "text": "⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️\n\nNikki Beach is the perfect spot if you’re looking for great food with an amazing beachfront atmosphere. The location is beautiful, the service was friendly and attentive, and everything we ordered was fresh and flavorful. The combination of the ocean views, relaxing music, and overall vibe made the experience even better. Whether you’re stopping by for lunch, brunch, or just drinks by the beach, it’s definitely a place worth visiting. I would absolutely come back!",
