        "rating": 4,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "The service was great as expected at this price point. The food was very good although the beef a bit dry. The seafood rice dish was well prepared and fresh but a bit diminutive compared to price. The cocktails were also a little over complicated for my palette. Too many different flavors that clash instead of compliment. All in all a good meal. My only real complaint would be the extremely loud and over-bassed music. It eliminates any chance of conversation and creating a shared experience.",
