        "text": "My friend and I came to La Cañita Bayside while we waited to board our cruise. I loved the decor, and there was beautiful live music. The drinks and food were absolutely delicious, with good portions. Kendall was our server. He was friendly and fast, and he made this a great first visit. I will return the next time I’m in the area.",
