        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago",
        "text": "La Wagyeria in Miami delivers a truly memorable experience with an unpretentious, laid-back atmosphere that lets the food take center stage. The menu is thoughtfully curated, with a clear focus on prime, high-quality ingredients, and the result is exceptional—easily some of the most tender and flavorful beef I’ve ever had. A standout moment comes when selecting your cut in the restaurant’s butcher lab—an experience I won’t spoil, as it’s best discovered firsthand and adds a unique touch to the evening. If you appreciate great ingredients, simplicity done right, and a bit of surprise, this is a spot worth planning your next visit around.",
