        "text": "Simply the best Italian restaurant in town!!\nIf you look for a nice Italian place to have lunch, of diner, do not hesitate anymore.\nI came several time to this restaurant for many occasion, lunch with friends, family, and dates…\nThe place is very clean, it doesn’t take hours to get served, and everybody there is smiling…they bring you a piece of Italy in Miami!\nI tried almost all the dishes in the menu, I loved them all.\nThe food is fresh and traditional, all the waiters there are very nice and friendly and make you feel like home and the prices are very, very honest!\nYou also have a big choice of wine!\nShout out to my favorite waiter « the mini rigatoni » !!\nCan t wait to come back to see you guys!!",
