        "text": "Thank you Sarah for the  amazing service& recommendation of BRUS pizza & wine   . 1st time at this cozi  neighborhood Italian Restaurant . If I lived here , I would be a weekly / bimonthly regular :) thank you",
        "isSpiceMention": false
