        "text": "What a great place. I had never had Ecuadorian food, so I didn’t know what to expect. The flavors from every dish are just so bright and refreshing with everything. The cornbread may be the best I’ve ever had in my life. Amazing fresh seafood. The meat empanada and mahi ceviche are also not to be missed. Can’t wait to come back and try some of the dishes we missed… or maybe just do all the same things again",
