        "text": "First time trying out this place. Very excited for all the gluten free options and non alcoholic drinks! Our waiter Remy has an amazing energy. We really enjoyed his service. We had the applesauce lemonade, which was very refreshing and tasty. The brussel sprout appetizer was so good. Just delicious flavor bombs. And the butternut squash gf pizza was very unique and tasty. We finished with the gf carrot cake and vanilla marscapone, which was devine. Highly recommend this place.",
