        "rating": 2,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Service was very slow although there where barely any people... Food tasted off, the grains on my grain bowl had a distinct sort of sour taste and the sweet potato had various textures (some were tender others very soft). The sweet potato also had some interesting dark spots. My mother's bowl contained cold and hard chicken that almost tasted a few days old. I didn't enjoy the food at all (not including that it was kind of expensive) and the time for the server to get us a table was absurdly long. Only nice thing was the restaurant decor the pleasant smelling soap in the bathroom....",
