        "text": "Went here on our vacation after shopping trying something new and healthy. They have indoor and outdoor seating. We did outdoor by the water feature. Had jambalaya pasta, lasagna, peppermint tea, and carrot cake for desert. We loved it all. We’re sad because there is no location were we live (yet). If you go to this location as for the great waiter Remy (the mayor).",
