        "text": "I had an incredible experience at Old Lisbon, and a big part of that was thanks to Rodrigo, the manager. From the moment we walked in, he treated us like family, warm, genuine, and incredibly welcoming. That kind of hospitality is rare, especially in Miami, and it’s honestly something I’ve been searching for since I moved here 10 years ago.\n\nRodrigo went above and beyond to make us feel at home, and it truly made the entire experience special. On top of that, the food is absolutely amazing, every dish was outstanding.\n\nI’m really happy to have found this place and will definitely be coming back frequently. Highly recommend!",
