        "text": "Very elegant flavor and thoughtful cuisine🍴. The tuna tartare was delightful and very fresh. The French onion soup is a must-have. I'm glad I have great cuisine so close to my area. The bar also had excellent, well-made drinks.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
