        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "We had a phenomenal lunch experience. For starters we had the crab cake. We had the chicken thigh chops with the mushroom risotto for lunch. Our waiter made a good call and brought our meals family style, with the sides separate, and he brought us out the brussels sprouts. For desert we had the “Grand Marnier” Soufflé with Orange Marmalade. Everything was amazing. Thank you Two Chefs restaurant. Parking was easy. I highly recommend you dine here.",
        "isSpiceMention": false
