        "text": "La Boulangerie Boul’Mich at the Sunset location may not be the nicest or most visually appealing compared to others, but overall the experience was still good. The place is decent and comfortable enough to enjoy a meal. The food was solid, especially the Key West omelette, which was flavorful and well prepared. Service was good and everything came out on time. It’s not my favorite location in terms of ambiance, but it definitely delivers where it matters most—the food. I would come back again, especially for breakfast",
