        "text": "Had the best birthday dinner here with great GREAT service. I loved every dish that we had and I never find that in a restaurant. If you like Spanish food this place is a must try because they put a twist on it and we even had to ask for seconds on the octopus and basque cheesecake which is the best I’ve had in Miami so far.",
