        "text": "I had visit this restaurant for the first time maybe two weeks ago. The service was impecable and the atmosphere was amazing. Not too many places in Sunny Isles where you can have a restaurant experience on the beach. All of the service members were professional, polite, and they all moved like a well oiled machine. I had the pleasure of meeting the manager James and you can tell they know what they’re doing. I order two of their sushi rolls and I must say this sushi chef must be the best in South Florida. I will definitely be returning and I’m bringing friends next time. I need to share this experience as much as I can.",
