        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUBKyWp-7aw6oljSDDMBHwDyhlfDtyW60HqvzbJS3myrVzi96Y=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "If you’re seeking a special dinner - this is your place. It’s a greek restaurant with a special fresh fish bar on display. The service was very attentive but not too much.\nWe tried several dishes and went for an exotic japanese fish we hadn’t heard of before. The waiters suggestion was amazing.\nHigh ceilings and a fine vibe.\nMust try!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
