        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXYRW7y2D-V6MOKo2DR7ry3EGd30ST2buUyuGMo5mO5AqIhi24=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "The service was phenomenal. I enjoyed the staff and every morsel that I ordered from the kitchen. The tortellini and zucchini flowers were PERFECT, and I thoroughly enjoyed the orange wine I tried for the first time. Such an exquisite experience. I applaud everyone working in the building for maintaining and servicing such an elegant restaurant. I give my thanks for such high standards at this location. 🌹",
        "isSpiceMention": false
