        "text": "Another excellent dinner at Doma! It’s race week here and Miami is hectic and swarming with people. Doma was jam packed but still managed to be an oasis of relaxation. Christian was helpful and friendly, everything we ate was executed perfectly. A delicious and wonderful meal. Thank you!",
