        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "We went to Kyu for a Mother’s Day lunch. They did a beautiful job  to make it a lovely Mother’s Day.   They gave flowers to all the moms and also had a little box of chocolates for the table as well. Our server was very kind and knowledgeable about the menu. We ordered the softshell crab bao buns, the roasted cauliflower and the Japanese sweet  potato. Everything was delicious. It was a wonderful experience.",
