        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago",
        "text": "One of the best dinners we’ve had in miami. The food was a 10/10. We had the cauliflower, gyoza, and short rib and split it between 2 people and it was PLENTY of food. We even had some leftovers which we took home with us. Great bar selection as well. You wouldn’t necessarily know it from the outside, but this place is a hidden gem within the wynwood district. Would definitely return!!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
