        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Amazing experience from start to finish! The fried chicken with yuzu ranch, caviar, and chili butter was absolutely delicious, and the Pink Puppy lychee cocktail was the perfect complement. Special thanks to Sol for presenting the dishes, Edwin for the amazing cocktails, and manager Octavio for the warm hospitality. Can’t wait to come back!",
