        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Loved this place! It was amazing and the food and atmosphere was out of this world. We got the lomo saltado, the empanada, arepa and octopus chicharrón. Paz was such a great waitress and made me and my partner feel so welcomed. Definitely would come back again.",
