        "authorPhoto": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVRi3UYK2DK_LLlN-dTkB-m6lRlusQUGzo8Hh8aprPuFQNlFG0U=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago",
        "text": "We really liked this place. The food was fantastic and not over salted. We’ve been going out a lot lately and love the fact they didn’t hammer it with salt, but still had a ton of flavor. The grilled avocado side was a surprise underdog that we 10/10 recommend as an app. The crab pasta special was really nice, fresh pasta, and great flavor not overdone. Also the house rigatoni with ribeye was really flavorful. We loved this place and would definitely go back. Oh also the cocktails were on point.",
