        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Phenomenal modern restaurant with a focus on South American flavors. Beautiful atmosphere, pleasant music, delicious food that was wonderfully plated and well portioned. Our server was attentive and friendly and the entire dining experience was flawless. This restaurant sets a good example for how others in Miami should follow. It's elegant, fun, and tasteful. It's pragmatic and celebratory all at once. Not flashy. I got the impression that there is a cohesive and strong team culture among the staff members. Keep up the excellent work 🌞",
