        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Chimba is all about the vibes. Warm, lively, and relaxed without trying too hard. It’s a place where you actually want to sit, eat, and enjoy the moment.\nI had the octopus chicharrón, lomo saltado, and flan de dulce de leche. Everything was so delicious.\nThe octopus chicharrón was crispy, tender, and packed with flavor.\nThe lomo saltado was savory, juicy, and straight comfort food done right.\nThe flan de dulce de leche was smooth, creamy, and indulgent. The perfect way to end the meal.\nService was great. My server was very attentive, and the staff overall was friendly and welcoming.\nI’d definitely come back. The food hits, the vibe is right, and the experience just works.",
