        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I celebrated my birthday at Bakan in Miami, and it was an incredible experience from start to finish. The atmosphere was vibrant and welcoming, making it a perfect place to celebrate.\n\nOur server, Cece, was amazing—attentive, friendly, and made us feel truly special throughout the night.\n\nWe started with the Queso Fundido con chorizo, which was very tasty and full of flavor. The drinks were good and well-made, but the real star of the night was dessert. The churros were the best I’ve ever had—crispy, warm, and absolutely unforgettable.\n\nOverall, the service, food, and atmosphere were excellent. I highly recommend Bakan and would definitely return!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
