        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Bakan is a great spot for dinner, but especially better for happy hour. If you come on a Tuesday, it’s $5 tacos and you can’t go wrong. The food is authentic and flavorful, with a large menu and options to choose from. But my favorite part was the drinks - both the Michelada and Margarita were fantastic. Also, the churros are to die for, so make sure to order dessert!",
