        "text": "This was a really decent spot for lunch and very attentive and so i came back for dinner and was greeted 180  opposite in the evening, the hostess didn’t speak English and later told us we could go in due to an event.\nThe was a couple of really good al pastor and chicken tacos, really guacamole and chips and then the Carne was very small and average compared to others in the neighborhood.\nWell designed and cool looking space food not as good as design.",
