        "text": "We had a fantastic dining experience last night at La Ferneteria. Everything we ordered was absolutely delicious, and our server, Victor, was outstanding—attentive, knowledgeable, and spot-on with his recommendations (bread for the carpaccio was a game changer).\n\nThe steak au poivre, arancini, and cocktails were definite highlights of the evening. Each dish was perfectly executed and full of flavor.\n\nThe ambiance deserves special mention as well—beautiful, relaxing, and comfortable, making it easy to truly enjoy the experience from start to finish.\n\nExcellent food, great service, and a welcoming atmosphere. We’ll definitely be back.",
