        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Had an incredible dining experience at Ziva. The branzino was absolutely phenomenal perfectly prepared, fresh, and full of flavor. The staff was attentive, professional, and genuinely welcoming from start to finish. The service was excellent, making the entire experience even more enjoyable. Midtown gem!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
