        "text": "I just come for hookah and drinks which I’ve known are too qualiry already, but me and my son had the lamb chops and Kafka today and food was 10/10  (destroys Motek’s food).  I was served again by Jeff today and even on a busy day the guy is super attentive and you feel like an appreciated customer.  Anyways I’m stuck as an every week customer",
