        "text": "I spent 9min on the phone trying to speak with someone that works there and no one picked up. Their AI model only works so much if no one bothers to pick up the phone. Both locations are like this.\n\nPlease add just veggie broth to the menu so I’m able to order online for my kids without having to call.",
