        "rating": 5,
        "relativeTime": "a month ago",
        "text": "Had an amazing experience at Pari Pari Handroll Bar! The food was fresh, flavorful, and beautifully prepared, with every handroll tasting incredible. What really made the experience stand out was our server, Alexander. He was attentive, friendly, knowledgeable about the menu, and made sure we had everything we needed throughout our meal.\n\nExcellent service paired with great food made for a fantastic dining experience. We’ll definitely be back and highly recommend asking for Alexander if you visit!",
        "isSpiceMention": false
