        "text": "We had an amazing experience, and our server, Estefani, made it even better. She was incredibly friendly, attentive, and professional throughout our visit. She made sure we had everything we needed and always checked on us with a smile. Her excellent customer service truly stood out. Thank you, Estefani, for making our meal so enjoyable. We will definitely be back!",
